WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.918
[Adam Lefkoe] Everyone
thinks they can catch punts.

00:00:01.918 --> 00:00:04.796
So we’re meeting up with punting
expert Johnny Hekker of the

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:07.924
L.A. Rams to see just how hard it really is.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.760
- [Taran Killam] These guys are goin’ down,
cuz when it comes to catchin’ punts, from a

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.304
machine, after a practice,
there’s nobody better.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.348
- [Caron Butler] These youngsters
ain’t got nothin’ on me.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.936
I’m about to put it down, right
now, no cap, catchin’ all balls.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:25.859
- [Lefkoe] Normally I’d make you catch these
hands, but today, these hands are catchin’ punts.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:29.863
- Yeah, they’re screwed.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.156
- Well, hello!

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.074
Lefkoe out here in L.A.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:38.163
I’m about to catch punts from Johnny Hekker,
one of the greatest special team players in

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:40.248
the history of the NFL.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:42.042
You know who else has a special team?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.126
State Farm.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:48.923
They’re sponsoring this entire season of
“Ditch the Playbook.” Talk about swell people.

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.133
Let’s go catch some punts.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.969
♪♪♪

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:59.100
What we have here today is the greatest
punter in the history of the NFL, Johnny Hekker.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.934
- [Laughing]

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.102
- Take the compliment.
- Thank you.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:04.981
- To his right, NBA legend
Tuff Juice, Caron Butler.

00:01:04.981 --> 00:01:08.818
And one of the funniest people you’re ever
gonna meet, the biggest Rams fan ever, Taran Killam.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:09.778
- Whose house?!

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.904
- Rams house.
- Woo!

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.780
- Damn right.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.906
- I did not know that cheer.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.491
Clearly I’m not a Rams fan.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.826
How this is gonna work:
It’s gonna be three rounds.

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:18.995
We each get one attempt per round.

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:22.040
And whoever has the most
catches at the end wins.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.461
Now, to make it fair, we’re all gonna get
the exact same punt from the JUGS machine.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:29.297
Whoever comes in last, there is a punishment.

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:32.300
So I’m asking you right
now—you have to agree.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.677
Do you agree to said punishment?

00:01:34.677 --> 00:01:35.345
- Agree.
- OK.

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.179
- Agreed.

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:37.222
- They’re agreed.
- [Whistling]

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:39.057
Johnny Hekker—I can’t believe they agreed.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:40.016
They fell for it.

00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:40.767
We’re set.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.644
- It’s gonna come down with some heat.
Don’t be afraid.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.311
- [Butler] Oooh!
- You’re gonna be OK.

00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:44.437
- [Killam] Thank you, Captain.
- [Butler] Fire!

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.438
- [Killam] Ready to rise to the challenge.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.356
- Bruises heal—

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:47.482
- [Killam] Yes.
- Legends are forever.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:48.775
- [Killam] Yes.
- [Butler] Oooh, that’s a good one.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.901
- [Killam] Clear eyes, full hearts.
- Let’s do it.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.194
- Taran Killam’s up for the first round.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:52.695
- [Hekker] All right, make sure we
give him, give him a little space.

00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:54.364
Fair catch, fair catch rules.

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:57.200
- Feelin’ a lotta pressure right now.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.118
- Give him the point when you’re ready.

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:01.037
- [Lefkoe] Oh, the point is up.

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:04.165
- [Hekker] OK, coming back to his left.

00:02:06.084 --> 00:02:07.794
- [Collective] Ohhh!

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:08.670
- [Butler] Good catch!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:09.462
- You got a ball?

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.046
- [Lefkoe] Yeah.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.090
- Watch this, watch this.

00:02:13.383 --> 00:02:14.759
- [Lefkoe] Yeah.
- [Butler] And—

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.887
- Into it.
- Ohhh.

00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:19.389
- One hop into the bucket?
Ahh.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:20.682
- [Killam] One-hop Wednesday.

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:21.307
- Darn it.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.893
- [Lefkoe] Oh, here’s Caron.

00:02:23.893 --> 00:02:25.645
- [Hekker] Caron, it’s coming back to
your left, coming back to your left.

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:29.274
- [Everyone] Yes!

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.651
- [Hekker] Good job, Caron.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.193
That was incredible.

00:02:32.193 --> 00:02:34.445
Way to go.
- Now all the nervousness has come to me.

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:34.821
- [Killam] Yeah.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:35.280
- [Hekker] Yeah.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.740
Oh, no.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.741
- [Killam] That’s ugly.

00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:39.868
That’s ugly.

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:40.451
That’s—

00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:41.703
- Ohhh!

00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:43.163
- [Lefkoe] I went—damn!

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.330
- [Hekker] Yeah, we saw.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.832
Someone said something about a punishment?

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:46.499
- [Killam] Yeah.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.293
- [Lefkoe] Yeah, there’s
three rounds, Johnny Hekker!

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.169
- Ohhh, you’re right.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:49.627
- [Lefkoe] Damn!

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:52.589
After the first round, Caron: 1.

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:54.090
Taran: 1.

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.050
Lefk: O.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:56.634
Damn.

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:58.887
And he’s enjoying this way too much.

00:02:58.887 --> 00:02:59.888
- No, I’m not. I’m not, I’m not.

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:01.014
- Yeah, you are. You’re laughing!

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.473
- I’m in panic mode right now.

00:03:02.473 --> 00:03:03.308
- [Lefkoe] Here, Taran.

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:04.309
- Evan!

00:03:04.309 --> 00:03:06.060
Can you switch it to, uh, lefty?

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:06.936
- [Killam] Oh, actually, I’m sorry.

00:03:06.936 --> 00:03:07.604
That’s against my religion.

00:03:07.604 --> 00:03:08.938
- [Butler] Lefty spiral.
- [Hekker] Oh, no, lefty.

00:03:08.938 --> 00:03:10.940
- [Killam] Yeah, I’m a
righty spiral only kinda guy.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.026
- [Lefkoe] What’s really funny is I have no
idea the difference between a righty or a

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.027
lefty at all.
- [Hekker] Oh, yeah.

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:16.196
- [Lefkoe] Bro, you did that way too easily!

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.197
- Yeah, they’re screwed.

00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:19.157
- [Butler] Oh, goodness.

00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:19.908
- Wow.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.246
- Ohhh!

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:27.624
- [Butler] Yoooo!

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:28.333
Get the dirt off your shoulders!

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:29.751
- That is how you show out.

00:03:29.751 --> 00:03:30.627
- God!

00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:31.502
Jeez!

00:03:35.298 --> 00:03:37.133
- [Hekker] To your right, to
your right, to your right.

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.301
- Ohhh, Jesus!

00:03:38.301 --> 00:03:40.011
- [Lefkoe] Oooh, don’t break a finger.

00:03:40.011 --> 00:03:41.304
- [Killam] That’s nice.
That gives me a cushion.

00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:42.138
That gives me a nice cushion, right?

00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:43.014
- [Butler] You gotta get under it, man.

00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:44.766
- [Lefkoe] Yes.
- [Butler] God!

00:03:44.766 --> 00:03:46.434
- You didn’t feel the grass.
- [Butler] I have a shot.

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:48.394
- [Hekker] Oh, look at this guy!

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:50.647
He said, he heard us say—

00:03:50.647 --> 00:03:51.689
- Oh, s--t!

00:03:51.689 --> 00:03:52.607
[Laughing offscreen]

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.691
- [Hekker] Oh, he’s gotta get over here.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.401
- [Lefkoe] Ah, f--k!

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:56.361
- Ohhh.
- [Lefkoe] Damn!

00:03:56.361 --> 00:03:58.321
- [Killam] And a finger and a, and a—
- [Hekker] Did you do it? Did you jam a finger?

00:03:58.321 --> 00:03:59.906
- I did.
- Oh, no!

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.824
- Yeah, I’m fine.

00:04:01.824 --> 00:04:03.326
I am gonna have to do this punishment.
- Oh, my goodness.

00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:07.205
- [Lefkoe] And I thought for sure that
Taran Killam was taking this punishment.

00:04:07.205 --> 00:04:08.039
Damn.

00:04:08.039 --> 00:04:13.836
I have zero, Tuff Juice has one, and
Taran Killam’s caught both out of nowhere.

00:04:13.836 --> 00:04:16.005
All right, so what are we doin’ here, Hekker?

00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:20.093
- [Hekker] So you gotta run to the spot and
catch the ball, so you gotta track it on the run.

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.594
This is makin’ things a little more difficult.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:24.472
For someone that’s 0-2, it’s
gonna be...

00:04:24.472 --> 00:04:26.641
damn near impossible.
So we’ll see how Lefkoe does.

00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:28.643
- All right.
- [Lefkoe] Such a d--k.

00:04:30.478 --> 00:04:31.104
- Go!

00:04:34.524 --> 00:04:35.483
- [Collective] Ohhh!

00:04:36.317 --> 00:04:37.568
- [Lefkoe] He was right there, though.

00:04:37.568 --> 00:04:39.612
- [Butler] Damn.

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.698
- Caron, the door has creaked open.

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:42.615
You gotta get going.

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:43.283
- [Killam] Nice, nice. Yes.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:43.866
- [Hekker] You gotta get going.

00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:45.118
- [Killam] He’s got it. He’s got this. He’s—

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:45.576
- [Butler] Ohhh, s--t!

00:04:45.576 --> 00:04:47.954
- [Killam] Yep, yep.
- [Lefkoe] We're alive.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.872
- [Killam] You eliminate the
chest, that’s what happens.

00:04:49.872 --> 00:04:51.291
- [Killam] You have that safety of the chest—

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:52.166
- [Hekker] That makes it tough.

00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:55.169
- Desperate times call
for desperate measures.

00:04:55.837 --> 00:04:56.963
- This is gross.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.798
- Get that outta here!
- What smells?

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.133
- No!

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:02.343
- Die, Eagles, die, more like.
- [Laughing] Die, Eagles, die.

00:05:02.343 --> 00:05:04.679
- For whatever he loves most,
he can’t catch it to save it.

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:05.972
- [Hekker] No.

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.557
- Listen. I’m gonna be like Vince Papale.

00:05:07.557 --> 00:05:09.475
- This is a—this is a serious thing.

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:11.394
- I hope that the punishment
is you have to eat that shirt.

00:05:11.394 --> 00:05:12.437
- Yo.
[Laughing]

00:05:12.437 --> 00:05:16.691
- [Hekker] I have never wanted someone
to get a punt in the nuts so bad.

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:17.108
- [Butler] That’s tough.

00:05:17.108 --> 00:05:17.567
- [Hekker] Over his head.

00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:18.651
- [Killam] He’s got it. He’s got it.

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:20.320
- [Collective] Ohhh!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.779
He’s got it.

00:05:21.779 --> 00:05:22.864
- Let’s go!

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:23.906
Let’s go!

00:05:23.906 --> 00:05:25.366
So now we gotta have a punt-off.

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:26.784
Me versus Caron Butler.

00:05:26.784 --> 00:05:27.160
- [Butler] Yes.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.119
- Congratulations, you’ve won.

00:05:28.119 --> 00:05:29.537
- Thank you very much.

00:05:29.537 --> 00:05:30.330
- Good job, Taran.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.542
- I should really thank all the people
who supported me on my way to get here.

00:05:34.542 --> 00:05:36.294
You know, they say don’t
forget the little people.

00:05:36.294 --> 00:05:37.295
- What is that playing?

00:05:37.628 --> 00:05:38.463
The music?

00:05:38.463 --> 00:05:39.881
- Uhhh—Coach McVay!

00:05:39.881 --> 00:05:40.923
[Group trying to drown him out]

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:43.176
Uhhh, Les Snead, Stan,
for your ambition, your vision!

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:46.637
- How do we wanna do sudden
death between me and Caron?

00:05:46.637 --> 00:05:49.057
Is it one fresh off your actual leg?

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:50.183
- Oh, yeah!

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:50.808
- Yeah, let’s do that.

00:05:50.808 --> 00:05:54.437
I’ll give you—I’ll give you guys an
end-over-end—with the wind at my back.

00:05:54.437 --> 00:05:55.563
So I’m gonna go this way.

00:05:55.563 --> 00:05:56.898
- [Butler] Ooh, that’s with the sun.

00:05:56.898 --> 00:05:58.274
- [Lefkoe] It is with the sun.

00:05:58.274 --> 00:06:00.818
- S--t.
- Well, you have sunglasses.

00:06:00.818 --> 00:06:01.694
- Still don’t help.

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:03.029
[Laughing]

00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:03.738
That’s only for the look.

00:06:03.738 --> 00:06:04.405
It’s not for the block.

00:06:04.405 --> 00:06:08.159
[Laughing]

00:06:08.159 --> 00:06:09.035
- [Hekker] All right, here we go, Caron.

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:09.994
Get this one, baby.

00:06:14.665 --> 00:06:15.416
- [Lefkoe] Damn.

00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:17.168
- Woo, baby!

00:06:17.168 --> 00:06:20.421
- Got my old ass out here moving!

00:06:20.421 --> 00:06:20.963
- That was good.

00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:23.174
- I'm gonna bomb this second ball

00:06:23.174 --> 00:06:26.427
over Lefkoe's head, so he
has no chance of winning.

00:06:26.427 --> 00:06:28.221
That's my strategy.

00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:30.640
- All right, Darren Sproles, you ready?

00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:34.227
That’s goin’.

00:06:34.602 --> 00:06:35.186
- Run!

00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:35.937
RUN!

00:06:37.188 --> 00:06:38.481
- Yes!

00:06:38.481 --> 00:06:39.941
- Suck it, Lefkoe!

00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:41.692
[Laughing]

00:06:41.692 --> 00:06:45.363
- Hekker punts it 80
yards when it’s my turn.

00:06:45.363 --> 00:06:47.198
- Tough day at the office for Lefkoe.
- [Lefkoe] Damn!

00:06:47.198 --> 00:06:48.533
- I think this is his own show, too.

00:06:48.533 --> 00:06:49.409
That’s sad.

00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:56.082
OK, so I hear we had, uhh, man,
just a real display of grit.

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:58.042
- I guess at the end of
the day, the actor won.

00:06:58.042 --> 00:06:59.168
- Yeah. Great job. Way to go.

00:06:59.168 --> 00:07:02.338
Lefkoe, I think this is your whole
deal, and you kinda blew it, so—

00:07:02.338 --> 00:07:03.214
- How do you feel about that?

00:07:03.214 --> 00:07:04.590
- I don’t feel good, Johnny.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.925
- And let’s bring out the punishment!

00:07:09.804 --> 00:07:11.722
[Laughing]

00:07:11.722 --> 00:07:14.725
Oh, and please just say it too a
couple times for the people at home.

00:07:14.725 --> 00:07:19.439
- It says that “I have big dumb baby hands”
and now I’m gonna have to go into the road

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:24.193
and stand in front of cars and let them
know that I have big, dumb, baby hands.

00:07:24.193 --> 00:07:24.777
[Laughing]

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:26.112
- Catch!

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:27.029
- Everybody!

00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:28.781
[Clapping]

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:31.325
♪♪♪

00:07:32.326 --> 00:07:33.786
- What has my life become?

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.079
Yep.

00:07:35.079 --> 00:07:35.746
Honk it up.

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:41.294
Ugh, crap.

00:07:47.592 --> 00:07:49.051
Stop beeping!

